{"title":"Career Roadmap: Group Reporting Manager","role":"Group Reporting Manager","summary":"Career Domain: Business, Finance & Entrepreneurship · Qualification Pathway: Professional Certifications - CA / CS / CMA / ACCA / CFA / CPA-India – ACCA (UK) / CPA (US) / CMA (US) · Target Career: Group Reporting Manager","facts":{"Current degree":"Professional Certifications - CA / CS / CMA / ACCA / CFA / CPA-India","Course":"ACCA (UK) / CPA (US) / CMA (US)"},"about":[{"label":"About this roadmap","text":"This roadmap was drafted with AI assistance from OneGrasp's related roadmaps and is awaiting expert review. Check fees, dates, eligibility and exam patterns on the official websites before you rely on them."}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Group Reporting Manager prepares the consolidated accounts of a group of companies - combining subsidiaries, eliminating inter-company items and reporting under IFRS or Ind AS."},{"type":"h","text":"What a Group Reporting Manager does"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Run group consolidation each month and year"},{"text":"Apply IFRS / Ind AS to complex items"},{"text":"Prepare group reports and disclosures"},{"text":"Coordinate auditors and subsidiaries"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Where they work:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Multinational groups"},{"text":"Listed Indian groups"},{"text":"Shared service centres"},{"text":"Big 4 advisory"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Career stage","Typical role"],"rows":[[{"text":"Entry-level"},{"text":"Reporting Analyst"}],[{"text":"Early career"},{"text":"Senior Accountant"}],[{"text":"Mid-level"},{"text":"Group Reporting Manager"}],[{"text":"Senior"},{"text":"Head of Reporting"}],[{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"Group Controller"}]]}]},{"heading":"Year-by-Year Learning Roadmap","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Early papers: Basics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Start ACCA papers"},{"text":"Learn accounting deeply"},{"text":"Excel"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Applied Skills: Reporting"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Clear financial reporting papers"},{"text":"Learn consolidation"},{"text":"Learn ERP basics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Strategic Professional: Qualify"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Clear Strategic Business Reporting"},{"text":"Complete PER"},{"text":"Join a reporting team"}]}]},{"heading":"Essential Skills","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Skill","Type"],"rows":[[{"text":"Consolidation"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"IFRS / Ind AS"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"Group reporting"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"Disclosures"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"Precision"},{"text":"Professional"}],[{"text":"Coordination"},{"text":"Professional"}],[{"text":"Deadlines"},{"text":"Professional"}]]}]},{"heading":"Tools and Technologies to Learn","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Consolidation software (e.g. OneStream, Oracle FCCS)"},{"text":"SAP"},{"text":"Excel"}]}]},{"heading":"Internships and Practical Experience","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Audit firms"},{"text":"Company reporting teams"}]}]},{"heading":"Certifications and Additional Training","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ACCA"},{"text":"ACCA DipIFR"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Before you enrol","text":"Check the current syllabus, fees and eligibility on the certifying body's official website."}]},{"heading":"Higher Education Options in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Options after your degree:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MBA (optional)"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Entrance exams and tests to know:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ACCA papers"}]}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad Options","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Group reporting roles in the UK, Europe, Gulf"}]}]},{"heading":"C